    "Huang Shilin is a former vice chairman of Contemporary Amperex Technology (CATL), one of the world's largest battery suppliers for the electric vehicle industry.",
    "Huang resigned from the board in 2022.",
    "CATL, dual-listed in Hong Kong and Shenzhen, supplies batteries to automakers including BMW, Geely and Tesla.",
    "Despite repeated pushbacks amid geopolitical concerns, a Ford battery factory in Michigan that licenses technologies from CATL has been completed in June 2026."
